# 美国 —— 自定义规则
# 引用:RULE-SET,<base>/rules/us.list,美国,extended-matching
# 合并自:US.yaml(已废弃)
# 最后更新:2026-09-01
# 说明:全文只用 DOMAIN-SUFFIX / DOMAIN-KEYWORD,Surge / Clash(mihomo)/ Shadowrocket / Loon 通用
# 原则:能用 suffix 就不用 keyword,避免误伤同名的非美国站点(如 .ca / .co.uk 分站)

# ================================================================
# 一、券商 / 投资
# ================================================================
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,firstrade
# IBKR 官网 / Client Portal / 下载
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,interactivebrokers.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibkr.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibkr.info
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibkrcampus.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibkrguides.com
# Charles Schwab / thinkorswim
# 注:原有的 DOMAIN-KEYWORD,schwab 已删,下面几条 suffix 已完全覆盖
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,schwab.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,schwabameritrade.com
# 实测在用,原配置遗漏
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,schwabassetmanagement.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,schwabbank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,thinkorswim.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tdameritrade.com
# Fidelity(含 401k / NetBenefits)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fidelity.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fidelityinvestments.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,netbenefits.com
# Vanguard
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vanguard.com
# E*TRADE / Morgan Stanley
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,etrade.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,etrade.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,morganstanley.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,morganstanleyclientserv.com
# Merrill Edge(BoA 旗下)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,merrill.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,merrilledge.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ml.com
# 其它零售券商
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,robinhood.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tastytrade.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tastyworks.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tradestation.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,webull.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,public.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,m1.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,m1finance.com
# 智能投顾
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,betterment.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wealthfront.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,acorns.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stash.com

